---
import { url } from '../config';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About NeonKey and Michael Ream: a tech hub for beginners and builders covering AI automation, homelab, honest reviews and a weekly email.">
  <article class="narrow page-head prose">
    <span class="kicker">About</span>
    <h1>About NeonKey</h1>
    <p class="lead">NeonKey is a tech brand about unlocking: making AI, gear, skills and the week's news easier to use, whatever your level.</p>
    <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
    <p>NeonKey is run by Michael Ream, a CIS student and builder who documents everything in public: homelab projects, automation builds and remote IT setups for small offices.</p>
    <h2>How NeonKey works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Honest by default:</strong> affiliate links are disclosed, and reviews are never paid placements.</li>
      <li><strong>Beginner-friendly:</strong> plain language first, details for those who want them.</li>
      <li><strong>No hype:</strong> no guarantees and no made-up numbers.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href={url('/newsletter/')}>Get Unlock the Week</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
